<title>UK: Tractabel sets 2.0 bln Luf 8-year bond.</title>
<headline>Tractabel sets 2.0 bln Luf 8-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers BGL and BCEE.</p>
<p> BORROWER   Tractebel SA</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     5.875     MATURITY    18.JUL.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.75    PAY DATE    18.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    LUX	 YIELD	 5.44 PCT</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 50-250    PRAECIPUUM 0.25</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
